Keep ring-buffer tests independent of pipe growth permissions.

Linux pipe-user-pages-soft pressure limits new pipes to two pages and
denies capacity increases (pipe(7)). Preserve the ring-size matrix and
FIFO assertions, bounding stress I/O by the existing pipe capacities.
Only test setup changes; the OCI runtime is unmodified.

